[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3046\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u9054\u306E\u624B\u4F1D\u3044\u3082\u4E00\u6BB5\u843D\u3057\u305F\u3057\u3001\n\u30ED\u30ED\u30CA\u306E\u30D1\u30A4\u3067\u3082\u98DF\u3079\u3088\u30FC\u3063\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh* Now that I\u0027m done helping Resna and the others, time to treat myself to some of Rorona\u0027s pie!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3089\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3082\u3054\u98EF\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my, are you getting something to eat too?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u304A\u5B88\u308A\u306F\u914D\u308A\u7D42\u3048\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia! Did you finish handing out all the charms?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u304A\u5B88\u308A\u306E\u4ED6\u306B\u7528\u610F\u3057\u305F\u304A\u307F\u304F\u3058\u3082\n\u697D\u3057\u3093\u3067\u3082\u3089\u3048\u3066\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, and everyone seemed to enjoy the fortune slips I prepared too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3002\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3089\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u3054\u98EF\u98DF\u3079\u306A\u3044\uFF1F\n\u304A\u3054\u308B\u308F\u3088\uFF5E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, why don\u0027t you join me for a meal? My treat~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\u3000\u3084\u3063\u305F\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? Yay!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3048\u3070\u3001\u304A\u5B88\u308A\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01\n\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306B\u3082\u304F\u308C\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way, thank you for the charm! I can\u0027t believe you gave one to me too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F53\u305F\u308A\u524D\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3002\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u306F\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u304A\u4E16\u8A71\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3082\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course I did. You\u0027ve been such a great help to us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30C8\u30EA\u30A8\u306B\u6765\u3066\u65E9\u3005\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u8ABF\u5408\u306B\u5354\u529B\u3057\u3066\n\u304F\u308C\u305F\u3057\u3001\u4E00\u4EBA\u524D\u306B\u306A\u308B\u8A66\u9A13\u306E\u6642\u3060\u3063\u3066\u5354\u529B\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As soon as you came to the atelier, you helped Resna with her syntheses, and you even assisted during her qualification exam."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u53BB\u5E74\u306E\u304A\u5B88\u308A\u914D\u308A\u306E\u6642\u3060\u3063\u3066\u6D3B\u8E8D\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u308F\u3002\n\u3044\u3064\u3082\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were a huge help last year with distributing charms too. Thank you for everything."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u304B\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "O-oh, was I really?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8B19\u905C\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u306A\u3044\u306E\u3088\uFF1F\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306F\u3067\u304D\u308B\u4EBA\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No need to be modest. You\u0027re a very capable person."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3078\u3078\u3002\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u307B\u3081\u3089\u308C\u3066\u308B\u3068\u3001\n\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u30A2\u30AB\u30C7\u30DF\u30FC\u306B\u3044\u305F\u9803\u3092\u601D\u3044\u51FA\u3059\u306A\u3042",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. Getting praised like this reminds me of my days at the academy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u3088\u304F\u5148\u751F\u306B\u307B\u3081\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306E\u304B\u3057\u3089\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? Did your teachers praise you often?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u9006\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF01\u3000\u3044\u3063\u3064\u3082\u6012\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Actually, it was the opposite! I was always getting scolded!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3089\u3001\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\uFF1F\u3000\u4FE1\u3058\u3089\u308C\u306A\u3044\u308F\u3002\u512A\u79C0\u306A\u306E\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, really? That\u0027s hard to believe, given how talented you are."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6614\u306F\u5168\u7136\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3092\n\u53B3\u3057\u304F\u53F1\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u5148\u751F\u304C\u3044\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wasn\u0027t very good at all back then. But there was this teacher who would scold me pretty strictly..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u5148\u751F\u3082\u3001\u6700\u5F8C\u306B\u306F\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3092\u307B\u3081\u3066\u304F\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though in the end, even that teacher praised me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u5148\u751F\u3068\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306E\u307E\u306A\u3056\u3057\u304C\u3001\n\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u4F3C\u3066\u308B\u6C17\u304C\u3059\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You know, the way you look at your students reminds me of that teacher."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3060\u308D\u3046\u2026\u2026\u6839\u3063\u3053\u306E\u512A\u3057\u3055\u304C\u4F3C\u3066\u308B\u306E\u304B\u306A\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder why... Maybe it\u0027s the underlying kindness that\u0027s similar?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3002\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u305F\u3089\u3001\u79C1\u3082\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u306E\n\u5148\u751F\u307F\u305F\u3044\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3060\u304B\u3089\u4F3C\u305F\u306E\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. Perhaps it\u0027s because I\u0027m something of a teacher to Resna too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3046\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah... that might be it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305F\u307E\u306B\u304A\u3063\u3061\u3087\u3053\u3061\u3087\u3044\u3060\u3063\u305F\u308A\u3001\u9762\u5012\u304F\u3055\u304C\u308A\n\u3000\u3060\u3063\u305F\u308A\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3042\u308B\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even though she can be a bit clumsy sometimes, and occasionally tries to take the easy way out...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306F\u3001\u3059\u3054\u304F\u5C0A\u656C\u3067\u304D\u308B\u4EBA\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3046\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Saskia is someone I really look up to.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3093\u30FC\u3001\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\uFF01\u3000\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u30ED\u30ED\u30CA\u306E\u30D1\u30A4\u306F\u6700\u9AD8\u306D\u3002\n\u30DE\u30EB\u30ED\u30FC\u30CD\u3055\u3093\u3082\u65E9\u304F\u98DF\u3079\u306A\u3044\u3068\u51B7\u3081\u3061\u3083\u3046\u308F\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmm, delicious! Rorona\u0027s pie really is the best. Better eat up before it gets cold, Miss Marlone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u306F\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, right!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u304D\u3063\u3068\u3053\u306E\u4EBA\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u306A\u3089\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3082\u3059\u3050\u306B\n\u3000\u679C\u3066\u306E\u5927\u9678\u3078\u3068\u305F\u3069\u308A\u7740\u3051\u308B\u3088\u306D\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(With her guidance, I\u0027m sure Resna will reach the Edge Continent in no time!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306E\u306B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(... At least, that\u0027s what I thought.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u307E\u3055\u304B\u3042\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3046\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3001\n\u3000\u3053\u306E\u6642\u306F\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3044\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Back then, I never could have imagined what was about to happen.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]